# SIMULATION (model curve), NOT an observation. Gangolli et al. (2025), JCAP 2025(03), 069 (arXiv:2408.08358), Fig. 2 (green solid): x_HI = 1 - x_ion^V, the volume-weighted ionized fraction (linear axis).
#   "Ndot_ion ~ L_UV" model (fiducial): ionizing output proportional to the galaxy UV luminosity.
#   FlexRT multi-frequency ray-tracing radiative transfer (200 cMpc/h; haloes from a 3600^3 N-body run) with sub-grid sinks;
#   the emissivity Ndot(z) is an INPUT, tuned for each model to the mean Lya transmission of Bosman et al. (2022; XQR-30) at
#   z = 5-6; h = 0.68.
#   Read from the published RASTER figure (pixel-traced, ~1 px uncertainty; curve hidden under other lines left as gaps);
#   curve: Gangolli2025_2408.08358/extracted/Gangolli2025_Fig2_xHI_Nion-propto-LUV.csv in the papers folder.
